  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "莊子",
    "sub_ename": "ZHUANGZI",
    "describe_ch": "莊子是人類史上偉大的思想家。其書在哲學、文學、藝術、政治…等。\n領域皆深具啟發性，是人類智慧的豐富寶藏。然其語言極具辯證性，讀者常陷於文字及義理的雙重障礙。本課程將引導學生閱讀《莊子》，解開其意義，體味其意韻。",
    "describe_eh": "Zhuangzi is a great thinker in the history of human civilization. His book is deeply inspiring in various fields such as philosophy, literature, art, politics, and so on. It is a rich treasure trove of human wisdom. However, his language is highly dialectical, and readers often encounter dual barriers between his language and meaning. This course will guide students to read Zhuangzi, decipher its meaning, and appreciate its artistic conception.",
